/-!
## Native Omega detection by the original cofiber mapping fiber

The original quotient pushout gives the full actual mapping pullback.
Its zero-source mapping object is compared with the unchanged pointed
native point by its original terminal universal property. The resulting
fiber is the actual native strict fiber of the original mapping restriction.

The proved Serre-fiber loop theorem retains every component of the actual
one-sphere internal-Hom map. The original coefficient Quillen adjunction,
scalar mapping adjunction and native spectrum delooping recover the full
unshifted Omega-target restriction tests.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false
noncomputable section
universe u v

open CategoryTheory CategoryTheory.Limits CategoryTheory.EnrichedFunctorCat MonoidalCategory
open HomotopicalAlgebra
open HomotopicalAlgebra.EnrichedProjective.Native
open HomotopicalAlgebra.EnrichedProjective.Native.OperatorStabilizationK
open PointedCGWH.EnrichedFunctorMapping
